msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Eenfach Bedrief"

#. +> trunk
#: simplesettings.cpp:92
msgid ""
"<p><b>Slow<br/>"
"(low-res / slightly blurred images)</b></p>"
"<p>In this mode the automatic detection and correction of the red eyes is the most reliable. The drawback of the higher detection rate is a much slower computation.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Langsam<br/>"
"(Siet Oplösen / en beten verwischt Biller)</b></p>"
"<p> In disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert dat automaatsche Finnen un Richten vun root Ogen op't Best. Man allens hett sien Pries: Dat Utreken bruukt so sien Tiet.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: simplesettings.cpp:97
msgid ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p>"
"<p>This mode is adequate for most image resolutions. Always try this mode first.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p>"
"<p>Disse Bedriefoort passt to de mehrsten Bildoplösen. Probeer ehr jümmers toeerst ut.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: simplesettings.cpp:101
msgid ""
"<p><b>Fast<br/>"
"(high-res images)</b></p>"
"<p>In this mode the automatic detection will be faster, but more false positives may occur. Use this mode only for very high-resolution and sharp images.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Gau<br/>"
"(hoge Oplösen)</b></p>"
"<p>In disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert dat Finnen gauer, man dat gifft ok mehr leeg Drepers. Bruuk de Bedriefoort bloots bi scharp Biller mit redig hooch Oplösen.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:67
msgid "Storage Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för't Sekern"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>These settings control the storage of the corrected images. There are three modes to choose from:</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Subfolder:</b> The corrected images will be saved in a subfolder under the current album path.</li>"
"<li><b>Suffix:</b> A custom suffix will be added to the corrected image.</li>"
"<li><b>Overwrite:</b> All original images will be replaced.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Instellen stüert dat Sekern vun de richt Biller. Dat gifft dree Metoden:</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Ünnerorner:</b> De richt Biller warrt binnen en Ünnerorner vun den aktuellen Orner sekert.</li>"
"<li><b>Verwiedern:</b> En egen Verwiedern warrt dat richt Bild toföögt.</li>"
"<li><b>Överschrieven:</b> Do Orginaalbiller warrt överschreven.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:85
msgid "Enter the name of the subfolder here."
msgstr "Hier bitte den Naam vun den Ünnerorner ingeven"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:89
msgid "Save files in a subfolder"
msgstr "Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner sekern"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:90
msgid "If checked, the corrected files will be saved in a subfolder under the current image album path."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt de afarbeidt Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner vun't aktuelle Bildalbum sekert."

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:94
msgid "Add suffix to filename"
msgstr "Suffix na Dateinaam tofögen"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:95
msgid "If checked, a custom suffix will be added to the corrected file."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt richt Dateien dat angeven Suffix anföögt."

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:98
msgid "Overwrite original files"
msgstr "Orginaaldateien överschrieven"

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:99
msgid "If checked, all original images will be replaced."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt all Orginaaldateien utwesselt."

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:104
msgid "Enter the name of the suffix here..."
msgstr "Hier bitte den Naam för't Suffix ingeven..."

#. +> trunk
#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p><i>Note: At the moment this plugin will not keep any metadata (EXIF, IPTC).<br/>"
"To prevent data loss, overwrite mode has been diabled for now.</i></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><i>Beacht bitte: Opstunns wohrt dit Moduul keen Metadaten (Exif, IPTC).<br/>"
"Dormit keen Informatschonen wegkaamt, is de Överschrievbedrief eerstmaal utmaakt.</i></p>"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:60
msgid "Unprocessed Images Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för nich afarbeidt Biller"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<p>These settings control the handling of unprocessed images when running in testmode. To speed up the final correction, unprocessed images can be removed from the list, so that they don't get analyzed again. There are three modes to choose from:</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Ask the user:</b> A popup window will appear to ask for further actions.</li>"
"<li><b>Keep:</b> All unprocessed images will be kept in the list.</li>"
"<li><b>Remove:</b> All unprocessed images are removed after testrun.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Instellen stüert, wat min nich afarbeidt Biller in den Testbedrief maakt warrt. Du kannst de Biller, de sik nich afarbeiden laat, vun de List wegmaken. De Biller bruukt denn nich nochmaal ankeken warrn un de hele Akschoon geiht gauer. Dat gifft dree Mööglichkeiten:</p>"
"<p>"
"<ul> "
"<li><b>Bruker fragen:</b> En Opdukfinster fraagt na, wat de Bruker will.</li>"
"<li><b>Wohren:</b> De Biller blievt op de List.</li>"
"<li><b>Wegmaken:</b> All Biller, de sik nich afarbeiden laat, warrt na den Testloop vun de List wegmaakt.</li>"
"</ul>"
"</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:80
msgid "Ask the user"
msgstr "Bruker fragen"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:81
msgid "If checked, the user will be asked to keep or remove unprocessed images."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Bruker fraagt, wat he nich afarbeidt Biller wohren oder wegmaken will."

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:85
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "Wohren"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:86
msgid "If checked, unprocessed images will be kept after test-run."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt nich afarbeidt Biller na den Testloop wohrt."

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:89
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Wegmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:90
msgid "If checked, unprocessed images will be removed from the images list after test-run."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt nich afarbeidt Biller na den Testloop vun de Billerlist wegmaakt."

